------------------------------------------------------------------------------
potion-base-8M
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The embedding table in crates/tasqx-core/assets/embed/model.bin is derived
from potion-base-8M by Minish Lab (Stephan Tulkens and Thomas van Dongen),
https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-base-8M, revision
bf8b056651a2c21b8d2565580b8569da283cab23, released under the MIT License.
tasqx stores it quantised to 8 bits per value (scripts/embedding-model.py).

The WordPiece vocabulary in crates/tasqx-core/assets/embed/vocab.txt, and the
tokenizer rules crates/tasqx-core/src/embed/tokenizer.rs reproduces, are those
potion-base-8M ships, taken from BAAI's bge-base-en-v1.5,
https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5, released under the MIT License.
That vocabulary descends from Google's BERT (bert-base-uncased),
https://github.com/google-research/bert, released under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

